OBJECTIVE: 
To implement a Java program using inheritance and method overriding by creating a Plan class and extending it with a PostpaidPlan class. 
ALGORITHM: 
1.Start the program. 
2. Create a Plan class with planName and dataLimitGB. 
3. Define a constructor to initialize these attributes. 
4. Create PostpaidPlan as a subclass of Plan. 
5. Add billingCycle to PostpaidPlan. 
6. Override the display() method in PostpaidPlan. 
7. Create a PostpaidPlan object. 
8. Display all plan details.
9. Stop the program. 
